      "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 16 2022 18:40:19 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The streets of north Philadelphia are no strangers to poverty and violence. But inside Temple University Hospital’s Level 1 Surgical ICU, a dedicated team of nurses come together every day for a shared purpose. Together, they face trauma after trauma head on – all the while quietly helping to strengthen their community. Through their shared experiences of tremendous grief, miraculous recoveries, and everything in between, this unit has become a family and forged unbreakable bonds. This is their story.</span></span></p>\n",
